3	/**
4	 * Thrown when a request to create or update an owner carries an email whose domain is on the
5	 * disposable-domain blocklist (e.g. mailinator.com, tempmail.com, guerrillamail.com). The address is
6	 * syntactically valid but not acceptable. Carries the offending value so
7	 * {@link DisposableEmailExceptionHandler} can report what was actually seen. Checked so it appears in
